  "description": "<p style=\"border: 0px solid rgb(217, 217, 227); box-sizing: border-box; margin: 1.25em 0px; caret-color: rgb(209, 213, 219); color: rgb(209, 213, 219); font-family: S&ouml;hne, ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Ubuntu, Cantarell, 'Noto Sans', sans-serif, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, 'Apple Color Emoji', 'Segoe UI Emoji', 'Segoe UI Symbol', 'Noto Color Emoji'; font-size: 16px; white-space: pre-wrap; text-decoration: none;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Introducing the newest addition to the fragrance world: SofG, the ultimate unisex scent that embodies the essence of greatness. Are you ready to experience what greatness smells like?</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"border: 0px solid rgb(217, 217, 227); box-sizing: border-box; margin: 1.25em 0px; caret-color: rgb(209, 213, 219); color: rgb(209, 213, 219); font-family: S&ouml;hne, ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Ubuntu, Cantarell, 'Noto Sans', sans-serif, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, 'Apple Color Emoji', 'Segoe UI Emoji', 'Segoe UI Symbol', 'Noto Color Emoji'; font-size: 16px; white-space: pre-wrap; text-decoration: none;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Picture this: You're walking down a bustling city street, and the sounds of cars and chatter fill your ears, but all you can focus on is the invigorating scent wafting from your skin. It's a unique blend of fresh, sweet, and woody notes that leaves a lasting impression on everyone who crosses your path.</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"border: 0px solid rgb(217, 217, 227); box-sizing: border-box; margin: 1.25em 0px; caret-color: rgb(209, 213, 219); color: rgb(209, 213, 219); font-family: S&ouml;hne, ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Ubuntu, Cantarell, 'Noto Sans', sans-serif, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, 'Apple Color Emoji', 'Segoe UI Emoji', 'Segoe UI Symbol', 'Noto Color Emoji'; font-size: 16px; white-space: pre-wrap; text-decoration: none;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">SofG is more than just a fragrance, it's a statement. It's for those who dare to dream big and achieve even bigger. With SofG, you'll feel confident, powerful, and unstoppable, as if you can take on the world and conquer it with ease.</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"border: 0px solid rgb(217, 217, 227); box-sizing: border-box; margin: 1.25em 0px; caret-color: rgb(209, 213, 219); color: rgb(209, 213, 219); font-family: S&ouml;hne, ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Ubuntu, Cantarell, 'Noto Sans', sans-serif, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, 'Apple Color Emoji', 'Segoe UI Emoji', 'Segoe UI Symbol', 'Noto Color Emoji'; font-size: 16px; white-space: pre-wrap; text-decoration: none;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">The top notes of SofG now feature a sweet hint of strawberry, with zesty citrus and crisp green apple also present. The heart notes are where the magic happens, with a blend of spicy ginger and cardamom that adds a subtle warmth to the fragrance. Finally, the base notes of smooth sandalwood and rich amber provide a deep, woody finish that lingers on your skin long after the day is done.</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"border: 0px solid rgb(217, 217, 227); box-sizing: border-box; margin: 1.25em 0px; caret-color: rgb(209, 213, 219); color: rgb(209, 213, 219); font-family: S&ouml;hne, ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Ubuntu, Cantarell, 'Noto Sans', sans-serif, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, 'Apple Color Emoji', 'Segoe UI Emoji', 'Segoe UI Symbol', 'Noto Color Emoji'; font-size: 16px; white-space: pre-wrap; text-decoration: none;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">So what are you waiting for? Take the first step towards greatness and try SofG today. Whether you're heading to a business meeting, a night out on the town, or just want to feel extra special, SofG has got you covered.</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"border: 0px solid rgb(217, 217, 227); box-sizing: border-box; margin: 1.25em 0px 0px; caret-color: rgb(209, 213, 219); color: rgb(209, 213, 219); font-family: S&ouml;hne, ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Ubuntu, Cantarell, 'Noto Sans', sans-serif, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, 'Apple Color Emoji', 'Segoe UI Emoji', 'Segoe UI Symbol', 'Noto Color Emoji'; font-size: 16px; white-space: pre-wrap; text-decoration: none;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Order now and experience what greatness smells like. Your journey to success starts here</span></p>",
